Design the processing section for the register transfer description given below by establishing the necessary control points.

Declare registers A[4], B[4], D[4];
Declare bus outputs [4];

Start: A \leftarrow 0, B \leftarrow 0, D \leftarrow 4;
Loop: if A < B and D[0] == 0 then go to transferA
      go to Decrement;
transferA: A \leftarrow B;
           B \leftarrow A + B;
Decrement: D \leftarrow D - 1;
           if D <> 0 then go to loop
           outbus = A;
Halt: go to Halt
